<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink186-kilavi">
       pakaṟkuṟikkaṇvantu nīṅkuntalaimakaṉait tōḻi ceṟippaṟivuṟīi varaivukaṭāyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       The confidante suggesting marriage to the hero who left, having come to the daytime meeting place, having informed [him] of [he heroine's] confinement [at home].</p>
  </div>   
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink186">
<l>nārai nalliṉaṅ kaṭuppa makaḷir</l>
<l>nīrvār kūnta luḷarun tuṟaiva</l>
<l>poṅkukaḻi neyta luṟaippa vittuṟaip</l>
<l>palkāl varūun tēreṉac</l>
<l>cellā tīmō veṉṟaṉaḷ yāyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh man from the ghat</l>
        <l>In which ladies’ tresses that overflow with water are ruffled,</l>
        <l>Resembling a good flock of waders,</l>
        <l>Mother said, ‘Do not go to this ghat  </l>
        <l> Where a chariot comes many times, </l>
        <l>So that it wilts the Neytal flowers in the bursting backwaters.’</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
